---
import SectionHeader from '../ui/SectionHeader.astro';
---

<section class="py-24 px-4 sm:px-8 lg:px-12 bg-[var(--color-canvas)] border-t border-[var(--color-hairline)]" id="seo-manifesto">
  <div class="max-w-[1280px] mx-auto space-y-20">
    <header class="border-b border-[var(--color-hairline)] pb-8 sm:pb-12 max-w-4xl">
      <SectionHeader
        eyebrow="DIGITAL STUDIO MANIFESTO"
        title="ENGINEERING THE MODERN DIGITAL IDENTITY."
        description="We are Kindlor. A highly specialized digital agency focusing on performance, aesthetics, and business automation."
      />
    </header>

    <div class="flex justify-start">
      <button id="seo-read-more-btn" class="text-[11px] font-mono font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-[var(--color-primary)] hover:text-[var(--color-ink)] transition-colors border border-[var(--color-hairline)] bg-[var(--color-surface-soft)] hover:bg-[var(--color-surface-card)] px-6 py-3 rounded">
        Read More About Kindlor ↓
      </button>
    </div>

    <div id="seo-content-wrapper" class="hidden">
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-12 lg:gap-24">
      
      <!-- Column 1: Studio Philosophy -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-6 space-y-8">
        <div class="space-y-4">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-sans font-bold text-[var(--color-ink)] uppercase tracking-tight">The Kindlor Studio Approach</h3>
          <div class="space-y-4 text-[15px] sm:text-[16px] text-[var(--color-body)] font-sans leading-relaxed">
            <p>
              In today's hyper-competitive digital landscape, relying on an Instagram page or a generic template is no longer enough to establish a trusted brand. This is where <strong>Kindlor Studio</strong> steps in. We are a premier digital agency and arguably the <strong>best website builders company</strong> for ambitious brands looking to scale. 
            </p>
            <p>
              At the core of the <strong>Kindlor company</strong> philosophy is the belief that design and engineering must operate as a single, cohesive unit. When you partner with us to <strong>make website</strong> infrastructure, you aren't just getting a digital brochure. You are receiving a fully optimized, database-driven machine designed to capture leads, automate tasks, and rank highly on search engines. 
            </p>
            <p>
              The <strong>Kindlor agency</strong> focuses heavily on performance. By utilizing modern frameworks like Astro, React, and Tailwind CSS, we ensure that every pixel is intentional and every line of code serves a purpose. We don't believe in bloat. We believe in high-contrast, flat, engineering-grade interfaces that communicate trust instantly. 
            </p>
            <p>
              Our systems are built for businesses that require more than just aesthetics. From online booking systems that sync with your calendar to WhatsApp lead flows that connect directly to your CRM, the solutions provided by <strong>kindlor</strong> are designed to solve actual business problems, reducing administrative overhead and increasing conversion rates globally.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="space-y-4 pt-8 border-t border-[var(--color-hairline)]">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-sans font-bold text-[var(--color-ink)] uppercase tracking-tight">Finding the Right Developer</h3>
          <div class="space-y-4 text-[15px] sm:text-[16px] text-[var(--color-body)] font-sans leading-relaxed">
            <p>
              Business owners often ask themselves, "how do I find a <strong>developer who can build website for my busniss</strong>?" The answer lies in finding a partner who understands both the technical architecture and the business objectives. 
            </p>
            <p>
              A standard developer might assemble a template, but the <strong>developers</strong> at Kindlor engineer bespoke digital environments. When you need to <strong>make website</strong> functionality that actually converts visitors into paying customers, you need a team that understands user experience, server-side rendering, and API integrations. 
            </p>
            <p>
              By focusing heavily on SEO architecture and lightning-fast edge performance, we ensure that your digital identity is not only beautiful but discoverable. Every project we undertake is meticulously planned, designed, and coded to ensure maximum visibility and operational efficiency.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Column 2: The Team & Execution -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-6 space-y-8">
        <div class="bg-[var(--color-surface-card)] p-8 sm:p-10 rounded-2xl border border-[var(--color-hairline)] space-y-6">
          <div class="flex items-center space-x-3 mb-6">
            <div class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-[var(--color-primary)]"></div>
            <span class="text-[10px] font-mono text-[var(--color-muted-soft)] uppercase tracking-widest">LEADERSHIP & ENGINEERING</span>
          </div>
          
          <h3 class="text-2xl font-sans font-bold text-[var(--color-ink)] uppercase tracking-tight">Meet the Kindlor Developers</h3>
          
          <div class="space-y-4 text-[15px] sm:text-[16px] text-[var(--color-body)] font-sans leading-relaxed">
            <p>
              The driving force behind our digital solutions is the <strong>Kindlor team</strong>, spearheaded by our founders: <strong>Mittul Daal</strong> and <strong>Arshmeen</strong>. Together, they represent the perfect fusion of robust system architecture and uncompromising visual design.
            </p>
            <p>
              <strong>Mittul Kindlor</strong> (as clients often refer to him) leads the technical division. As an expert in backend architecture, databases, and business automation, Mittul ensures that the infrastructure powering your business is scalable, secure, and incredibly fast. His approach to engineering is methodical, prioritizing static rendering and optimized asset delivery to achieve sub-second load times globally.
            </p>
            <p>
              On the visual front, <strong>Arshmeen Kindlor</strong> directs the UI/UX experience. Arshmeen believes that an interface should be intuitive, accessible, and striking. By maintaining a strict adherence to our high-contrast design system, Arshmeen crafts user journeys that guide visitors naturally toward conversion points, ensuring that the visual aesthetic amplifies the underlying technology rather than competing with it.
            </p>
            <p>
              The synergy between <strong>Mittul Daal</strong> and <strong>Arshmeen</strong> is what sets the <strong>Kindlor developers</strong> apart from traditional agencies. There are no disconnected hand-offs between design and development. Every feature is conceived with technical constraints in mind and engineered with absolute aesthetic rigor.
            </p>
            <p>
              When you collaborate with the <strong>Kindlor team</strong>, you are working directly with the architects of your digital success. We don't outsource our core competencies. From the initial discovery phase to the final deployment on Cloudflare or Vercel, our founders are intimately involved in ensuring the final product exceeds expectations.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="space-y-4 pt-4">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-sans font-bold text-[var(--color-ink)] uppercase tracking-tight">The Technical Advantage</h3>
          <div class="space-y-4 text-[15px] sm:text-[16px] text-[var(--color-body)] font-sans leading-relaxed">
            <p>
              We leverage an advanced technology stack centered around Astro and React. This allows us to deliver interactive "islands" of functionality only where necessary, keeping the majority of your site statically rendered for maximum speed and SEO efficiency. 
            </p>
            <p>
              Whether it is a custom booking system, a dynamic product catalog powered by Drizzle ORM, or a seamless WhatsApp lead generation flow, the <strong>Kindlor agency</strong> ensures that the technical foundation of your business is built for the future.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<script>
  // Ensure script runs on client-side navigation as well if view transitions are used
  const setupSeoToggle = () => {
    const btn = document.getElementById('seo-read-more-btn');
    const wrapper = document.getElementById('seo-content-wrapper');

    if (btn && wrapper) {
      // Remove old listeners to prevent duplicates on navigation
      const newBtn = btn.cloneNode(true) as HTMLElement;
      btn.parentNode?.replaceChild(newBtn, btn);
      
      newBtn.addEventListener('click', () => {
        wrapper.classList.toggle('hidden');
        if (wrapper.classList.contains('hidden')) {
          newBtn.innerHTML = 'Read More About Kindlor ↓';
        } else {
          newBtn.innerHTML = 'Read Less ↑';
        }
      });
    }
  };

  document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', setupSeoToggle);
  document.addEventListener('astro:page-load', setupSeoToggle);
</script>
